        "search-for-success :parameters (?character - character ?object - object ?room - room) :precondition (and (believes-at ?character ?character ?room) (believes-in ?character ?object ?room) (at ?character ?room) (in ?object ?room)) :effect (and (has ?character ?object) (not (in ?object ?room)) (believes-has ?character ?character ?object) (not (believes-in ?character ?object ?room))))": "(:action search-for-success :parameters (?character - character ?object - object ?room - room) :precondition (and (believes-at ?character ?character ?room) (believes-in ?character ?object ?room) (at ?character ?room) (in ?object ?room)) :effect (and (has ?character ?object) (not (in ?object ?room)) (believes-has ?character ?character ?object) (not (believes-in ?character ?object ?room))))",
